{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56135","headline":"三涂五苦颂八首 六 · 杜光庭","name":"三涂五苦颂八首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人命已销尽，亦犹膏中火。\n四大暂相寓，五物权时假。\n盛年当勤学，趣求存无我。\n福尽身福散，冥冥地狱下。\n上圣畏是故，寻道度斯祸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}